{'symbol': 'IFF', 'date': '2022-07-26 16:15:00', 'title': "DEBORAH BORG APPOINTED IFF'S EVP, CHIEF HUMAN RESOURCES AND DIVERSITY & INCLUSION OFFICER", 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IFF (NYSE: IFF) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT DEBORAH BORG WILL JOIN THE COMPANY AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, CHIEF HUMAN RESOURCES AND DIVERSITY & INCLUSION OFFICER, EFFECTIVE AUGUST 29, 2022. PETER SOMMERS—CURRENTLY INTERIM CHIEF HUMAN RESOURCES OFFICER—WILL RESUME THE POSITION OF VP, GLOBAL PEOPLE SERVICES AND SUPPORT BORG FOR A SEAMLESS TRANSITION. BORG JOINS IFF FROM BUNGE LIMITED, WHERE SHE SERVED AS CHIEF HUMAN RESOURCES AND COMMUNICATIONS OFFICER SINCE 2016. IN THA'}